    - Rachel_Got_Speed
    - Lily_Pondered
    excludedStoryFlags: []
    flagsToSet: []
    requiredPreviousTopic: 
    lines:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Hey bartender~
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Who let you back in the bar?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Oh come on, I just wanted to say hi! You\u2019re fun to talk to!"
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019ll pretend that was a compliment. Thank you."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: So, any plans?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Well, I\u2019ll be very busy soon."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Chaos and turmoil will be all over the forest tomorrow.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "When that happens, I\u2019ll be ready~ all those scared, unattended
        wallets will be mine for the taking~"
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: ... One of these days, that lifestyle is going to bite you back.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "But it hasn\u2019t yet~"
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: How about you just get me a drink? Something sweet will do.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: Sure. Why not?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
