      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: "Oh come on, I just wanted to say hi! You\u2019re fun to talk to!"
      effect: 1
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: "I\u2019ll pretend that was a compliment. Thank you."
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: So, any plans?
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: The usual. Rent is due at a lot of places and its really easy to snag
        some good stuff off people who are getting evicted~
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
      text: ...Oh my god that is genuinely evil...
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: Oh shove it.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000}
      text: How about you just get me a drink? Something sweet will do.
      effect: 0
      bonusGold: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a117d69041774e64883c4a1f3ddec85b, type: 2}
